WEBVTT

01:44.789 --> 01:46.320
The situation is critical.

01:46.710 --> 01:48.440
I'll get straight to the point.

01:48.590 --> 01:49.450
Third Brother,

01:50.560 --> 01:53.220
did you secretly practice
the Voidheart Codex?

02:03.280 --> 02:05.000
So that's what

02:07.000 --> 02:08.110
you're here to ask.

02:10.030 --> 02:11.400
Rumor has it that

02:11.750 --> 02:13.550
you have the Hero Command Token.

02:13.630 --> 02:15.280
That day at the Golden Summit,

02:15.280 --> 02:17.000
the Hero Command Token you gave Zhichen

02:17.000 --> 02:17.750
is only a map,

02:17.870 --> 02:19.470
and not the Voidheart Codex.

02:19.630 --> 02:20.430
Could it be...

02:21.120 --> 02:22.240
you took it away?

02:23.360 --> 02:25.310
You lost all your martial skills,

02:26.240 --> 02:28.440
but suddenly you have internal energy.

02:28.560 --> 02:29.960
I thought it was strange.

02:30.310 --> 02:33.120
And that day on the Golden Summit,
Zhao Shirong said

02:33.120 --> 02:34.650
you took the Infinite Pill.

02:34.870 --> 02:35.750
Is that true?

02:38.079 --> 02:38.880
That's right.

02:39.630 --> 02:42.290
I accidentally got
the elixir from Shao Liulei.

02:42.840 --> 02:44.360
As for the Hero Command Token,

02:44.360 --> 02:45.680
I didn't know

02:45.680 --> 02:47.750
it was hidden in Mr. Zhang's dagger.

02:49.800 --> 02:50.630
You heard it.

02:51.120 --> 02:54.680
Li Chenzhou also once mentioned the origin
of the Hero Command Token.

02:54.680 --> 02:55.360
There was

02:56.680 --> 02:58.280
no Voidheart Codex.

02:59.710 --> 03:00.520
But Qiushui,

03:01.080 --> 03:03.120
you know what kind of person
Li Chenzhou is.

03:03.120 --> 03:04.680
That man is extremely cunning.

03:04.680 --> 03:06.140
Can we believe what he say?

03:07.190 --> 03:08.750
What Yiren means is

03:09.520 --> 03:11.590
if you practiced the Voidheart Codex,

03:11.590 --> 03:13.360
just tell us.

03:14.240 --> 03:16.900
This will give us hope to revive
the Xiao family.

03:17.360 --> 03:17.960
Wushang,

03:20.120 --> 03:21.470
you trust me too?

03:22.470 --> 03:24.680
If I really practiced the Voidheart Codex,

03:24.680 --> 03:25.880
how could Li Chenzhou

03:26.630 --> 03:28.890
have suppressed me at the Golden Summit?

03:29.240 --> 03:31.280
How could I have watched

03:32.030 --> 03:33.030
Zhu the Great King

03:33.400 --> 03:36.120
use fake elixirs to deceive
the whole martial world.

03:36.120 --> 03:37.190
What do you mean?

03:37.800 --> 03:38.910
Are you blaming me?

03:39.840 --> 03:41.680
What did I steal the pill for?

03:42.310 --> 03:43.970
It was to end off the Power Gang

03:44.030 --> 03:45.560
and revive the Xiao family.

03:53.910 --> 03:54.590
Yiren,

03:56.000 --> 03:57.130
I'm not blaming you.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.710
The three of us

04:02.280 --> 04:04.840
haven't had a meal together
like this for a long time.

04:04.840 --> 04:05.590
We should really

04:05.590 --> 04:07.470
stop doubting each other

04:07.750 --> 04:09.680
for unnecessary things like this.

04:10.000 --> 04:11.000
I'm really tired.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.310
I'm mentally exhausted.

04:13.910 --> 04:14.520
Yiren.

04:14.840 --> 04:15.400
Qiushui.

04:15.750 --> 04:16.800
The dishes are getting cold.

04:16.800 --> 04:18.130
We haven't eaten at all.

04:18.190 --> 04:19.390
Let's eat some first.

04:19.800 --> 04:20.430
Fine.

04:22.040 --> 04:23.300
Tell me honestly then.

04:23.560 --> 04:24.820
Is the Voidheart Codex

04:25.720 --> 04:27.310
in your hands?

04:33.040 --> 04:33.720
Yiren.

04:34.720 --> 04:37.050
I really didn't take the Voidheart Codex.

04:37.120 --> 04:38.390
I don't have it.

04:42.800 --> 04:45.800
Looks like you're determined
to keep it for yourself.

04:46.000 --> 04:47.750
You've taken the Infinite Pill

04:48.270 --> 04:50.190
and learned other sects' martial arts,

04:50.190 --> 04:52.790
instead of promoting
Huanhua's martial arts.

04:53.190 --> 04:53.950
So,

04:54.720 --> 04:57.580
you are not qualified to be the sect's
young leader.

04:57.630 --> 04:58.630
In that case,

05:00.040 --> 05:01.500
give me the Changge Sword.

05:08.630 --> 05:09.360
Brother,

05:10.190 --> 05:11.600
the codex you've been looking for

05:11.600 --> 05:13.530
is also other sects' martial arts.

05:13.950 --> 05:14.810
The Xiao family

05:15.160 --> 05:16.480
can't be revived

05:16.480 --> 05:17.810
by one's stubbornness.

05:17.950 --> 05:19.680
Since I have the Changge Sword,

05:20.160 --> 05:21.270
I won't give it up.

05:22.270 --> 05:23.390
If you want it,

05:24.600 --> 05:25.680
come and get it.

05:27.360 --> 05:29.430
Yiren,
you have no respect for your brother!

05:29.430 --> 05:30.360
What do you mean?

05:30.430 --> 05:31.000
Qiushui...

05:31.000 --> 05:32.730
Are you forcing me to fight you?

05:34.800 --> 05:36.000
I don't mean that.

05:37.560 --> 05:39.430
You're being extremely biased right now,

05:39.430 --> 05:41.120
and you get to decide
what's good and what's not

05:41.120 --> 05:42.870
for Huanhua
all based on your personal views.

05:42.870 --> 05:45.680
So I can't give you the Changge Sword.

05:46.390 --> 05:49.240
I, Xiao Yiren,
no longer have you as a brother!

06:00.830 --> 06:03.160
Why are you getting more and more anxious?

06:09.160 --> 06:09.870
Yiren.

06:10.750 --> 06:13.510
You keep saying
that you want to revive the Xiao family.

06:13.510 --> 06:14.800
What are we reviving?

06:15.510 --> 06:16.770
It wouldn't be too late

06:17.480 --> 06:19.120
for us to drink this wine

06:20.430 --> 06:21.960
after we avenge our family.

06:49.600 --> 06:51.600
This is the recommendation letter
from Uncle Kang.

06:51.600 --> 06:54.400
I wish to compete fairly
for the Young Leadership.

06:56.159 --> 06:56.960
Xiao Qiushui.

06:57.120 --> 06:59.980
Why does he know
Shaolin and Wudang's martial arts?

07:01.040 --> 07:01.900
The Xiao family

07:02.240 --> 07:03.480
can't be revived

07:03.480 --> 07:04.810
by one's stubbornness.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.850
Since I have the Changge Sword,

07:07.310 --> 07:08.390
I won't give it up.

07:09.430 --> 07:10.560
If you want it,

07:11.680 --> 07:12.810
come take it from me.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.390
Who are you?

07:28.870 --> 07:30.630
How dare you break into
my mansion at night?

07:30.630 --> 07:32.000
Don't worry, Mr. Xiao.

07:32.510 --> 07:33.310
Let me guess

07:33.560 --> 07:35.560
why you are drinking alone here.

07:36.040 --> 07:39.430
Is it cause your brother showed off
at the Golden Summit

07:39.630 --> 07:42.310
and his martial arts and reputation
have surpassed yours.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.770
This is our family affair.

07:44.270 --> 07:45.800
It's none of your business.

07:46.000 --> 07:47.600
With your current strength,

07:47.720 --> 07:49.510
it's really hard for you
to outshine your younger brother

07:49.510 --> 07:52.040
and restore your family's honor.

07:52.680 --> 07:55.210
Why not borrow the power
from some dignitary?

07:55.240 --> 07:56.170
What dignitary?

07:57.480 --> 07:58.360
Think about it.

07:58.360 --> 08:01.190
Who is the most powerful person
in the world?

08:03.830 --> 08:05.160
It's easy for you to say.

08:05.510 --> 08:06.640
Why would he help me?

08:07.120 --> 08:10.160
As long as you help me get something
from the Nantian Abyss,

08:10.160 --> 08:12.390
I can help you connect with him.

08:13.750 --> 08:16.510
How do I know you're not lying?

08:17.270 --> 08:18.870
As long as you help me get it,

08:19.270 --> 08:21.390
you will believe everything I say.

08:26.950 --> 08:29.720
I found these five masters.

08:30.430 --> 08:32.830
From now on,
they will follow you secretly.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.270
They will help you

08:34.909 --> 08:36.789
when you need help.

08:52.630 --> 08:55.480
You used the Misery Pill
to torture us back then.

08:55.790 --> 08:57.320
It's now your turn to enjoy

08:57.320 --> 08:59.390
this pain so bad
that you wish you were dead.

08:59.390 --> 09:01.790
Beg me, and I will give you some food.

09:03.720 --> 09:05.440
Who do you think you are?

09:05.550 --> 09:06.670
You're but a lowly prisoner,

09:06.670 --> 09:08.110
yet you're saying such ridiculous things.

09:08.110 --> 09:09.440
I'll teach you a lesson–

09:13.480 --> 09:16.510
You're two days later than I expected.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.950
Old Madam Tang just ordered to let me go.

09:29.440 --> 09:30.790
Your expectations weren't wrong.

09:30.790 --> 09:32.840
In order not to irritate Old Madam Tang,

09:32.840 --> 09:35.200
Power Gang claimed
they had nothing to do with us.

09:35.200 --> 09:37.120
Fortunately, you told me
to contact both sides.

09:37.120 --> 09:38.650
This is from the other side.

09:42.270 --> 09:43.530
The Falconry Whistle.

09:44.150 --> 09:45.240
They want us to help

09:46.030 --> 09:47.670
play a bigger game.

12:25.200 --> 12:28.000
Northern Wasteland's
Intoxicating Bone Mist...

12:28.080 --> 12:29.360
You are not from Daxi.

12:30.480 --> 12:33.510
You have some knowledge of that place.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.870
So what is

12:37.870 --> 12:38.930
your real purpose?

12:41.960 --> 12:43.550
I should be asking you this.

12:44.550 --> 12:46.410
Didn't you always want to find me?

12:47.080 --> 12:47.670
So,

12:48.870 --> 12:49.630
I'm here.

12:57.200 --> 12:58.030
You're R.

13:01.360 --> 13:04.790
You're quite smart.

13:06.390 --> 13:08.240
To be able to find me

13:10.120 --> 13:11.450
through the Sword King.

13:14.670 --> 13:16.600
Since you are determined to get it,

13:17.480 --> 13:19.680
why don't you meet me
with your mask off?

13:22.200 --> 13:23.000
Don't worry.

13:24.790 --> 13:25.840
Before you die,

13:27.320 --> 13:29.270
I will let you see my face.

13:30.960 --> 13:31.510
But...

13:33.120 --> 13:36.840
you are still of some other use.

13:53.030 --> 13:53.790
This is...

14:07.750 --> 14:09.280
With your internal energy,

14:09.670 --> 14:11.130
no one in the martial world

14:11.150 --> 14:12.950
will be able to stand against me.

14:13.440 --> 14:14.300
It's about time

14:14.870 --> 14:17.600
for me to teach
the martial world a lesson.

14:17.870 --> 14:19.000
The Voidheart Codex

14:19.270 --> 14:20.320
is really him.

14:42.910 --> 14:44.480
Such strong internal force.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.360
I like it.

14:49.030 --> 14:51.030
You've been following me for so long.

14:51.030 --> 14:52.160
How can I lure you out

14:53.080 --> 14:55.140
if I don't put up a more realistic act?

15:04.550 --> 15:06.880
This man in black's martial arts are evil.

15:07.910 --> 15:09.970
Why did he absorb my internal energy?

15:10.390 --> 15:13.630
Who is he?

15:15.200 --> 15:15.870
Qiushui.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.200
You're back so late.

15:17.200 --> 15:17.750
You must be hungry.

15:17.750 --> 15:19.150
I saved some food for you.

15:24.510 --> 15:25.670
I'm not eating.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.970
I have no appetite.

15:31.360 --> 15:34.270
I just... saw R.

15:34.630 --> 15:35.320
R?

15:37.200 --> 15:38.240
Is he Liu Suifeng?

15:41.600 --> 15:42.270
No.

15:45.200 --> 15:46.550
Who do you think he is?

15:50.840 --> 15:52.170
Don't play dumb with me.

15:53.630 --> 15:54.430
Let me ask you.

15:55.550 --> 15:56.810
Do you know what secret

15:57.600 --> 15:58.530
Li Chenzhou has?

16:03.720 --> 16:04.630
Li Chenzhou

16:05.030 --> 16:06.720
has an unknown identity.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.720
He is the royal family of Daxi,

16:08.720 --> 16:10.320
the brother of the emperor,

16:10.790 --> 16:13.840
and the legitimate son
of the late emperor.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.630
What legitimate?

16:16.320 --> 16:19.750
That is, he's the son of the empress.

16:24.270 --> 16:25.320
What in the soap opera...

16:25.320 --> 16:26.480
Of course.

16:30.790 --> 16:32.270
Given what you said,

16:33.550 --> 16:35.630
the man in black used
the Northern Wasteland Drunken Bone Smoke.

16:35.630 --> 16:36.560
It's a rare item.

16:37.000 --> 16:40.510
Only those highly skilled
in the Northern Wasteland can get it.

16:40.510 --> 16:42.840
If Li Chenzhou
is the royal family of Daxi,

16:43.240 --> 16:45.040
he wouldn't have such close ties

16:45.080 --> 16:46.540
with Northern Wasteland.

16:47.000 --> 16:47.630
Exactly.

16:47.750 --> 16:49.840
I also think it's not Li Chenzhou.

16:50.000 --> 16:50.630
Look.

16:50.670 --> 16:53.480
With the deep hatred between Daxi
and the Northern Wasteland,

16:53.480 --> 16:56.680
it's impossible
for the Northern Wasteland to trust him.

16:57.360 --> 16:58.120
This matter

16:59.600 --> 17:01.000
is just our speculation.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.520
At the Golden Summit,

17:02.720 --> 17:04.000
I only met Li Chenzhou

17:04.510 --> 17:05.829
briefly.

17:07.069 --> 17:09.000
I didn't get to know more about him.

17:09.400 --> 17:13.069
We can only investigate secretly

17:13.510 --> 17:14.920
and see what he's up to.

17:38.480 --> 17:40.070
Looks like there are more people here

17:40.070 --> 17:41.480
than we expected.

17:41.790 --> 17:44.400
Other than those prominent sects
who were hit by the Tribulation Finger,

17:44.400 --> 17:46.640
seems like there are also some people
who are not afraid of death

17:46.640 --> 17:49.240
who heard that through the treasure hunt,
they could

17:49.240 --> 17:50.970
get a share of the benefits too.

17:51.350 --> 17:52.000
Let's go.

18:05.160 --> 18:06.200
Yiren, Kaiyan,

18:07.110 --> 18:07.790
Xiaoyi.

18:11.110 --> 18:12.480
This trip will be dangerous.

18:12.480 --> 18:13.510
Be careful.

18:20.240 --> 18:20.830
Yiren,

18:21.720 --> 18:23.450
don't be angry with him for now.

18:23.640 --> 18:25.500
Let's do what's important first.

18:27.000 --> 18:27.590
Let's go.

18:39.830 --> 18:41.880
I see you guys have come.

18:42.510 --> 18:43.750
But where is Chief Li?

18:43.960 --> 18:45.680
Our Chief is delayed by something.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.010
He is already on his way.

18:47.510 --> 18:48.640
We can go first.

18:50.200 --> 18:52.030
Chief Li launched this treasure hunt,

18:52.030 --> 18:53.290
yet he hasn't shown up.

18:53.720 --> 18:55.640
Is there something more to this?

19:00.920 --> 19:02.110
Don't worry.

19:02.830 --> 19:03.960
Looking at the time,

19:04.310 --> 19:06.370
our Chief should not be far from here.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.810
It's just a treasure hunt.

19:09.000 --> 19:10.460
Do you need so many people?

19:10.640 --> 19:12.830
As long as us Guidao Sect are here,

19:13.000 --> 19:14.480
it is more than enough.

19:16.030 --> 19:17.030
With your skills,

19:17.310 --> 19:19.160
you would be poisoned to death
by the miasma

19:19.160 --> 19:21.020
even before seeing the treasure.

19:26.440 --> 19:28.830
The Nantian Abyss's terrain is dangerous.

19:28.830 --> 19:30.750
It's covered by a miasma
throughout the year.

19:30.750 --> 19:33.480
This fog is not made out of
ordinary water vapour.

19:33.720 --> 19:34.510
It contains various

19:34.510 --> 19:36.750
poisonous herbs' poison.

19:38.350 --> 19:39.790
This is just the beginning.

19:39.790 --> 19:42.050
We don't know what other dangers it hides

19:42.270 --> 19:43.350
deeper in there.

19:44.030 --> 19:45.750
Everyone, be careful.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.260
Since you're here,

19:52.440 --> 19:53.640
how could you go back?

19:54.160 --> 19:56.030
Set off according to the map.

19:56.480 --> 19:58.160
The person who finds the treasure first

19:58.160 --> 19:59.620
will be greatly rewarded.

19:59.790 --> 20:01.510
Even if some of you die here,

20:01.750 --> 20:03.790
the Power Gang will give you a reward

20:04.350 --> 20:05.680
to comfort your family.

20:11.960 --> 20:12.550
Let's go.

20:14.960 --> 20:15.920
It seems that

20:15.920 --> 20:17.680
Nantian Abyss is not that simple.

20:17.680 --> 20:19.200
Be careful when you go in.

20:20.350 --> 20:21.790
-Don't worry, Wugun.
-Don't worry.

20:21.790 --> 20:22.520
Don't worry.

20:38.310 --> 20:41.400
This journey to the Nantian Abyss
was initiated by the Chief.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.880
But why are Shirong and Blade King

20:42.880 --> 20:43.880
heading this now?

20:44.200 --> 20:46.400
They asked us to follow behind them too.

20:47.070 --> 20:47.870
Could it be...

20:48.480 --> 20:49.940
The Chief has his own plan.

20:52.160 --> 20:53.480
Just execute accordingly.

20:53.480 --> 20:54.720
No need to say more things.

20:54.720 --> 20:55.160
Yes.

21:18.830 --> 21:20.240
After this miasma forest,

21:20.240 --> 21:22.370
we'll be completely
in Nantian Abyss.

21:23.070 --> 21:25.270
This place is full of poisonous miasma.

21:25.790 --> 21:27.510
It's really dangerous to break in.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.070
Yes.

21:28.310 --> 21:28.880
Kaiyan,

21:29.160 --> 21:30.760
how is your lightness skill?

21:31.270 --> 21:31.830
Yiren,

21:32.110 --> 21:34.110
although my swordsmanship is not advanced,

21:34.110 --> 21:35.440
but my legs are not bad.

21:37.640 --> 21:38.440
In my opinion,

21:39.270 --> 21:40.480
the air above is thin.

21:40.960 --> 21:42.620
You won't get poisoned there.

21:42.790 --> 21:44.990
Just move over it with lightness skill.

21:45.310 --> 21:45.920
Wait.

21:47.880 --> 21:48.550
Look.

21:55.920 --> 21:56.520
He's dead!

21:56.680 --> 21:58.440
How high up do you have to go
with the lightness skill?

21:58.440 --> 21:59.440
It's useless no matter how high you go.

21:59.440 --> 22:00.790
It's useless no matter how high you go!

22:00.790 --> 22:01.720
How can we pass?

22:02.750 --> 22:03.750
Th-That's right.

22:03.920 --> 22:05.050
We can't get over it.

22:07.790 --> 22:10.160
Abundance of wealth
is right in front of us.

22:10.160 --> 22:12.000
It's good
that people want to give up now.

22:12.000 --> 22:14.130
We have lesser people to split it with.

22:15.790 --> 22:16.650
I won't give up.

22:17.000 --> 22:17.590
Let's go.

22:19.110 --> 22:20.880
Those who are afraid of death can go back!

22:20.880 --> 22:21.310
Come with me!

22:21.310 --> 22:22.030
Who's afraid of death?

22:22.030 --> 22:23.000
Everyone, follow me.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.730
Hold your breath after we go in.

22:25.590 --> 22:26.480
-Okay.
-Okay.

22:27.750 --> 22:28.510
Follow me.

22:37.070 --> 22:37.880
Be careful.

22:38.400 --> 22:39.310
Don't die here.

22:42.030 --> 22:43.000
Yes.

22:53.070 --> 22:54.000
The Guidao Sect!

22:54.270 --> 22:55.600
You despicable people!

22:55.960 --> 22:56.920
How dare you

22:57.510 --> 22:58.920
secretly make a move in the forest,

22:58.920 --> 22:59.920
trying to harm me?

23:00.440 --> 23:02.920
Everyone is looking for the treasure
with their skills.

23:02.920 --> 23:03.920
If you're not as skilled last the others,

23:03.920 --> 23:04.680
it doesn't matter if you're poisoned

23:04.680 --> 23:05.750
or you fell to your death.

23:05.750 --> 23:07.350
Your life is not up to you.

23:07.350 --> 23:07.830
You...

23:08.200 --> 23:08.790
Enough!

23:10.590 --> 23:12.200
The road ahead is even more treacherous,

23:12.200 --> 23:13.790
and it will require our united efforts.

23:13.790 --> 23:15.680
If any of you seek
personal vengeance or gains

23:15.680 --> 23:17.270
and stir up internal conflict,

23:17.270 --> 23:19.160
I tell you this: when the Chief arrives,

23:19.160 --> 23:22.620
the poison of your Tribulation Finger
will not be detoxified.

23:25.240 --> 23:27.200
The same goes for everyone else.

23:27.960 --> 23:29.030
It was foolish of me.

23:29.030 --> 23:30.760
I dare not repeat this offense.

23:34.590 --> 23:35.160
Qiushui,

23:35.920 --> 23:36.880
look at this map.

23:37.590 --> 23:39.110
it doesn’t mark
where the treasure is hidden.

23:39.110 --> 23:40.770
How are we supposed to find it?

23:44.030 --> 23:44.960
All right, look,

23:45.400 --> 23:46.640
it's getting late,

23:47.070 --> 23:48.830
and everyone's been searching
for a long time.

23:48.830 --> 23:50.680
Why not hand over the maps you have?

23:50.680 --> 23:51.810
Let's pool our ideas

23:52.880 --> 23:54.740
and figure out where it really is.

24:00.750 --> 24:02.150
What kind of mess is this?

24:03.880 --> 24:05.140
Check here, everyone.

24:06.000 --> 24:07.030
Don’t you think

24:07.680 --> 24:08.740
this black pattern

24:09.110 --> 24:10.240
on the map

24:10.830 --> 24:12.350
looks especially like a dragon?

24:12.350 --> 24:13.200
Yeah, you’re right!

24:13.200 --> 24:14.960
See this part: doesn’t it
resemble the dragon’s body?

24:14.960 --> 24:16.000
And that—that’s a dragon claw!

24:16.000 --> 24:17.460
Exactly, that’s the claw!

24:18.070 --> 24:18.510
Wugun,

24:18.640 --> 24:19.400
look over here.

24:19.400 --> 24:21.750
Doesn’t this look like the dragon’s head
and a small claw?

24:21.750 --> 24:22.440
Yes.

24:22.640 --> 24:23.440
Could it be...

24:23.750 --> 24:24.550
That's right.

24:25.480 --> 24:26.920
Absolutely.
It really does look like a dragon,

24:26.920 --> 24:28.440
and this is clearly the head.

24:28.440 --> 24:29.110
The head...

24:30.960 --> 24:32.110
Golden Dragon Lifts Its Head...

24:32.110 --> 24:33.200
Golden Dragon Lifts Its Head?

24:33.200 --> 24:35.000
G—Golden Dragon Lifts Its Head!

24:37.030 --> 24:37.720
Let me see.

24:38.750 --> 24:39.550
Alright then.

24:40.200 --> 24:43.640
Since the "Golden Dragon Lifts Its Head"
should be found at the summit,

24:43.640 --> 24:45.790
that's where we need to go.

24:47.920 --> 24:49.450
Everyone, fan out from here

24:49.720 --> 24:52.750
and follow the map to search for the site
of the "Golden Dragon Lifts Its Head."

24:52.750 --> 24:53.680
Whoever finds it

24:54.000 --> 24:55.460
send up a signal firework.

24:56.070 --> 24:56.790
-Let's go.
-Let's go!

24:56.790 --> 24:57.200
Go.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.040
Let's go.

24:59.000 --> 25:00.200
Everyone, this way.

25:00.200 --> 25:00.860
Be careful!

25:01.030 --> 25:01.560
Let's go.

25:02.680 --> 25:03.440
Let's go.

25:03.590 --> 25:04.120
Let's go!

25:22.750 --> 25:24.750
We've been searching
for an entire day now,

25:24.750 --> 25:26.550
and still haven't found a thing.

25:58.000 --> 26:00.030
Take this—it will temporarily
boost your power twofold

26:00.030 --> 26:02.680
and suppress the effects
of the Tribulation Finger.

26:02.680 --> 26:03.140
Come on.

26:05.110 --> 26:07.750
Tonight, we only need to rest well.

26:08.350 --> 26:10.610
Once we retrieve the treasure tomorrow,

26:10.790 --> 26:12.550
we'll strike them by surprise.

26:15.590 --> 26:16.590
Once this is done,

26:16.590 --> 26:19.110
Zhu the Great King
will surely reward us well.

26:19.110 --> 26:19.750
Come on!

26:21.550 --> 26:22.510
This place is vast.

26:22.510 --> 26:23.030
Pass it to me.

26:23.030 --> 26:24.070
No wonder the Power Gang

26:24.070 --> 26:26.330
has gathered so many people to come here.

26:26.510 --> 26:29.170
Traveling by night
is actually more dangerous.

26:29.310 --> 26:30.370
I think it's better

26:30.400 --> 26:31.830
to stay and rest for now,

26:32.550 --> 26:35.510
and we can all continue the journey
first thing in the morning.

26:35.510 --> 26:36.550
-Right!
-That's right.

26:36.550 --> 26:39.010
Let's rest first.
Let them do the searching.

27:11.440 --> 27:12.200
It's you...

27:13.960 --> 27:14.680
Mr. Xiao,

27:15.790 --> 27:18.110
I am aware that you hold little trust
in the Power Gang.

27:18.110 --> 27:22.440
It is true that our sect is often
accused of ruthless actions

27:23.030 --> 27:24.720
and indiscriminate killing
within the martial world.

27:24.720 --> 27:28.380
However, the Power Gang
rarely kill anyone who's truly innocent.

27:30.350 --> 27:33.550
Years ago, when the Northern Wasteland
invaded our Daxi,

27:33.640 --> 27:35.920
a group known as
the Falconry Whistle emerged.

27:35.920 --> 27:37.640
They conspired
with the Northern Wasteland,

27:37.640 --> 27:38.640
providing them with detailed maps

27:38.640 --> 27:40.640
of the Central Plains
to aid their military campaigns.

27:40.640 --> 27:41.830
Many of those

27:42.480 --> 27:44.410
we have recently eliminated were,

27:45.110 --> 27:47.200
in fact, accomplices and followers
of the Falconry Whistle.

27:47.200 --> 27:49.030
That rhetoric of yours certainly

27:49.030 --> 27:50.640
absolves the Power Gang

27:51.310 --> 27:52.590
of all blame.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.480
So, by your logic,

27:55.110 --> 27:57.920
even a renowned orthodox sect
like the Diancang Sect

27:57.920 --> 28:00.120
was a lackey of the Northern Wasteland?

28:01.480 --> 28:04.310
The Diancang Sect was indeed
part of the Falconry Whistle,

28:04.310 --> 28:08.510
just like the Blood Talisman Sect,
which was wiped out by the White Phoenix.

28:08.790 --> 28:09.920
You've said plenty,

28:12.070 --> 28:13.130
but answer me this:

28:16.110 --> 28:17.570
what about my Xiao family?

28:18.790 --> 28:21.390
What about all those
innocent people who died?

28:23.790 --> 28:25.650
I had actually given orders early

28:26.030 --> 28:28.310
to only surround
the Xiao residence, not to kill.

28:28.310 --> 28:31.000
But by the time the second group
of Power Gang forces arrived,

28:31.000 --> 28:32.660
the Xiao family's Sword Manor

28:33.310 --> 28:34.840
had already been breached.

28:38.480 --> 28:39.680
What did you just say?

28:40.070 --> 28:42.530
The one
who slaughtered your Xiao Family...

28:42.640 --> 28:45.300
must have come from
within your own Sword Manor.

28:48.070 --> 28:48.830
Impossible!

28:50.240 --> 28:51.030
Li Chenzhou!

28:52.270 --> 28:53.600
I saw it with my own eyes.

28:54.680 --> 28:56.740
Senior Tianzheng and Senior Taichan

28:57.550 --> 28:59.440
were killed by your Power Gang!

29:00.310 --> 29:01.350
The Power Gang

29:02.830 --> 29:04.880
does bear responsibility in this matter,

29:04.880 --> 29:08.940
but only because someone used
the Thousand-Faces Mask to impersonate me

29:09.920 --> 29:12.520
and order
the deaths of Tianzheng and Taichan,

29:12.640 --> 29:14.370
leading to this grave mistake.

29:16.440 --> 29:18.970
That is also
why I took your parents' remains.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.880
My true intention

29:21.480 --> 29:24.010
was to investigate
the cause of their deaths.

29:28.920 --> 29:30.070
This was found

29:30.830 --> 29:32.550
near their bodies,

29:33.750 --> 29:35.550
though I do not know its meaning.

29:40.750 --> 29:41.680
Mr. Xiao,

29:43.160 --> 29:44.440
it seems we share

29:45.480 --> 29:46.790
the same enemy.

29:48.750 --> 29:50.640
After examination by the Herbal King,

29:50.640 --> 29:53.110
it was confirmed that your parents
were killed by a finger technique

29:53.110 --> 29:56.110
so rare that almost no one
in this world recognized it.

29:56.310 --> 29:59.000
Could it be
that Li Chenzhou truly isn't the R?

30:03.200 --> 30:04.260
With all that said,

30:06.550 --> 30:09.280
which sect
does this finger technique belong to?

30:09.400 --> 30:11.510
After we return from the Nantian Abyss,

30:11.510 --> 30:13.200
I will see to it
that your parents' remains

30:13.200 --> 30:15.060
are returned to the Huanhua Sect.

30:15.310 --> 30:17.960
As for the origins and details
of this finger technique,

30:17.960 --> 30:20.360
I will share all
that I know with you as well.

30:24.790 --> 30:25.550
Li Chenzhou,

30:26.550 --> 30:27.880
stop being so cryptic.

30:28.510 --> 30:31.400
This expedition to the Nantian Abyss
is highly suspicious.

30:31.400 --> 30:34.550
Could the Power Gang

30:35.070 --> 30:36.930
truly not have found the treasure

30:37.310 --> 30:39.110
without the help of these sects?

30:39.680 --> 30:43.200
Or did you gather all these people here

30:44.030 --> 30:45.760
with some other agenda in mind?

31:05.160 --> 31:05.960
Why?

31:08.590 --> 31:11.390
Who is really pulling the strings
behind all this?

31:59.240 --> 32:00.900
Golden Dragon Lifts Its Head.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.330
The door is open!

32:24.920 --> 32:26.720
Thanks to Mr. Xiao's sharp eyes.

32:27.790 --> 32:29.450
How about you take the lead and

32:29.880 --> 32:31.540
go check the path ahead for us?

32:31.640 --> 32:32.720
-Qiushui.
-Why don't you go in? You go!

32:32.720 --> 32:33.240
Go!

32:35.830 --> 32:37.510
The situation inside is unclear.

32:37.510 --> 32:39.440
Everyone, wait here—

32:39.830 --> 32:42.790
that way, when I come out,
there will be someone to provide backup.

32:42.790 --> 32:43.400
Qiushui,

32:43.830 --> 32:45.560
you must be extremely careful.

32:48.920 --> 32:50.120
Don't worry, Kaiyan.

32:55.550 --> 32:57.030
-Wugun, be careful.
-Be careful!

32:57.030 --> 32:58.430
He went in just like that?

32:59.070 --> 33:00.030
Let's go in too.

33:00.030 --> 33:01.230
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

33:06.510 --> 33:07.770
Why won't you let us in?

33:08.480 --> 33:09.610
We're already here!

33:09.680 --> 33:10.960
What gives you the right to stop us?

33:10.960 --> 33:12.440
That's right. We want to go in too.

33:12.440 --> 33:13.030
Let us in!

33:13.030 --> 33:15.760
What kind of scheme
is the Power Gang pulling now?

33:16.110 --> 33:17.400
Did you plan to use us

33:17.400 --> 33:18.880
and then keep all the treasure
for yourselves?

33:18.880 --> 33:20.590
T—That's right! Yeah!

33:20.590 --> 33:22.120
Why won’t you let us in? Why?

33:22.270 --> 33:23.000
Everyone,

33:23.920 --> 33:25.720
as you all witnessed
atop the Golden Summit,

33:25.720 --> 33:28.350
the Third Young Master of the Xiao family
possesses remarkable skill.

33:28.350 --> 33:29.950
If even he cannot make it out,

33:30.240 --> 33:32.770
any attempt of yours
would be equally futile.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.000
Moreover,

33:34.350 --> 33:36.750
Mr. Xiao has always
regarded us as enemies.

33:37.070 --> 33:38.270
With him also inside,

33:38.510 --> 33:40.240
how can anyone claim the Power Gang
seeks to monopolize the treasure?

33:40.240 --> 33:41.350
I don't believe you.

33:41.350 --> 33:42.590
Your words sound fair,

33:42.590 --> 33:44.850
but I insist on going in
to see for myself.

33:45.240 --> 33:45.590
I...

33:48.000 --> 33:49.720
Everyone, please remain calm.

33:49.720 --> 33:51.240
The treasure is right here—

33:51.240 --> 33:52.510
it isn’t going anywhere.

33:52.510 --> 33:54.880
I believe Mr. Xiao ventured ahead

33:55.070 --> 33:56.870
with everyone’s safety in mind,

33:57.110 --> 33:59.570
hoping to prevent unnecessary casualties.

34:36.110 --> 34:38.400
-What's going on?
-What happened inside?

34:38.400 --> 34:39.800
Oh no, Qiushui is in trouble!

34:39.800 --> 34:40.330
Save him!

34:40.880 --> 34:41.440
Wait.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.280
The situation is unclear right now.

34:43.280 --> 34:45.440
It’d be better for us
to split up and move separately.

34:45.440 --> 34:46.110
Fuhu Sect,

34:46.190 --> 34:46.800
Wuyi Gang,

34:47.030 --> 34:47.960
and Guidao Sect:

34:48.150 --> 34:49.550
follow the Power Gang

34:49.800 --> 34:51.590
to the south to find a suitable spot

34:51.590 --> 34:52.360
to place explosives,

34:52.360 --> 34:53.280
breach the rock face,

34:53.280 --> 34:54.320
and rescue Mr. Xiao.

34:54.320 --> 34:56.250
The rest of you, stay here and wait.

34:57.190 --> 34:58.320
Is that acceptable?

34:59.510 --> 35:02.310
This is leaving all of us
just waiting around here?

35:03.920 --> 35:06.180
-Fine.
-What exactly is going on inside?

35:09.840 --> 35:11.190
Why should we even listen to her?

35:11.190 --> 35:12.230
-Y—yeah, exactly!
-I'll listen to you. Let's go!

35:12.230 --> 35:13.510
-Go.
-Go!

35:15.360 --> 35:16.710
-Wugun!
-Wugun!

35:17.670 --> 35:18.000
Wugun!

35:18.000 --> 35:19.130
Let's think of a way.

35:19.360 --> 35:20.030
See if there's anywhere else

35:20.030 --> 35:21.280
we can get in.

35:36.880 --> 35:38.210
By tomorrow, every sect

35:38.230 --> 35:41.070
will have been affected
by the Tribulation Finger.

35:41.070 --> 35:42.510
Those affected will

35:42.760 --> 35:44.920
inevitably suffer heart-scorching agony.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.920
In his bid to seize the treasure,

35:47.400 --> 35:49.190
Zhu the Great King
has forced all his followers

35:49.190 --> 35:52.450
to take a pill that drastically
enhances internal energy—

35:52.480 --> 35:56.010
one that also temporarily
suppresses the Tribulation Finger.

35:56.110 --> 35:58.110
So tomorrow, whoever shows
no sign of being affected

35:58.110 --> 36:00.570
will surely be an agent
of Zhu the Great King.

36:01.230 --> 36:03.960
I will give you the signal tomorrow.

36:05.510 --> 36:08.320
Esteemed Sect Leaders:
we'll leave this cave entrance to you

36:08.320 --> 36:11.980
I will lead the gang members
forward to continue the exploration.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.030
Let's go!

36:19.110 --> 36:20.110
Stop wasting time.

36:20.110 --> 36:21.040
Open up the cave.

36:21.230 --> 36:23.090
Finding the gold is what matters.

36:23.670 --> 36:24.230
Let's go.

36:38.030 --> 36:40.560
The treasure lies
right behind the mountain.

36:47.590 --> 36:48.920
This is the Chief's order:

36:48.920 --> 36:51.580
the true location of the treasure
is right here.

36:51.760 --> 36:52.320
Go!

36:52.710 --> 36:54.760
Find the weakest point on the rock face.

36:54.760 --> 36:56.110
Blast through it and breach inside!

36:56.110 --> 36:56.770
-Yes!
-Yes!

37:11.320 --> 37:11.850
Let's go.

37:12.150 --> 37:13.510
Once inside,
we will split up and act separately.

37:13.510 --> 37:14.000
Good.

37:20.510 --> 37:20.970
Move it.

37:21.150 --> 37:21.710
Yes.

37:22.800 --> 37:24.600
There really is treasure! Gold!

37:24.670 --> 37:25.530
We're rich now!

37:27.800 --> 37:29.280
Mine, mine, mine!

37:47.070 --> 37:49.730
Everyone, stay sharp
and proceed with caution.

38:01.400 --> 38:02.200
Zhao Shirong!

38:03.400 --> 38:06.030
All of this was deliberately arranged
by your Power Gang!

38:06.030 --> 38:08.670
Your Guidao Sect, along with Wuyi Gang
and Fuhu Sect,

38:08.670 --> 38:10.710
pledged allegiance to Zhu the Great King

38:10.710 --> 38:13.110
and secretly destroyed countless
Power Gang strongholds.

38:13.110 --> 38:15.920
It's time we settled this account.

38:17.150 --> 38:18.000
What a pity—

38:18.110 --> 38:19.320
for all your loyalty,

38:19.630 --> 38:20.510
Zhu the Great King

38:20.510 --> 38:23.040
remains hidden in the shadows
until this day,

38:23.440 --> 38:25.100
too cowardly to show his face.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.920
So you knew all along.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.800
This entire affair at Nantian Abyss

38:28.800 --> 38:31.530
was all a scheme orchestrated
by your Power Gang.

38:31.670 --> 38:33.930
If you hadn't been scheming yourselves,

38:34.000 --> 38:35.670
how could you
have taken the bait so easily?

38:35.670 --> 38:37.000
We were all coerced here

38:37.000 --> 38:38.760
by your Power Gang.

38:39.110 --> 38:40.840
If anything happens to us here,

38:41.480 --> 38:44.140
how will you answer
to the entire martial world?

38:53.630 --> 38:55.190
That need not concern you.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.340
Show yourself.

39:09.480 --> 39:11.810
Though the Nantian Abyss is treacherous,

39:12.000 --> 39:14.460
it could hardly hold
the Power Gang captive.

39:14.760 --> 39:16.560
If you desired these treasures,

39:16.800 --> 39:19.200
you need not have resorted
to such schemes—

39:19.550 --> 39:20.710
luring us all here.

39:21.590 --> 39:22.990
What is it you truly seek?

39:30.280 --> 39:31.800
Qiushui, are you hurt?

39:31.800 --> 39:32.230
Qiushui!

39:32.230 --> 39:33.400
I'm fine. All good.

39:33.480 --> 39:34.610
Wugun, are you okay?

39:36.840 --> 39:37.360
Guys!

39:37.360 --> 39:38.360
We're rich! Haul it all away!

39:38.360 --> 39:39.030
Wait!

39:59.030 --> 40:01.190
Be careful—the hidden arrows
might be poisoned.

40:01.190 --> 40:04.120
Try not to make contact
while handling the treasure.

40:04.800 --> 40:05.760
-Move it!
-Let's go!

40:05.760 --> 40:06.890
-Move it!
-Let's go!

40:07.030 --> 40:08.160
-Hurry up.
-Move it.

40:10.360 --> 40:11.560
Real gold! Pure gold!

40:12.510 --> 40:13.440
Give me a hand here!

40:13.440 --> 40:14.230
Mr. Xiao.

40:24.150 --> 40:24.950
Zhao Shirong,

40:25.360 --> 40:26.960
back at Mount Emei's Golden Summit,

40:26.960 --> 40:29.480
your Power Gang promised everyone

40:30.000 --> 40:31.440
that this expedition to Nantian Abyss

40:31.440 --> 40:33.440
wasn't for selfish gain.

40:34.150 --> 40:35.840
Now the treasure is found.

40:36.230 --> 40:37.230
How you handle it—

40:37.800 --> 40:39.320
you owe us all an explanation.

40:39.320 --> 40:40.920
-Yeah, exactly!
-That's right!

40:40.920 --> 40:43.050
That's right. Give us an explanation.

40:43.110 --> 40:45.910
Mr. Xiao, why ask
when you already know the answer?

40:46.030 --> 40:48.230
The affairs of the border
are no secret to us.

40:48.230 --> 40:51.710
The Northern Wasteland army has now
massed heavy forcesat Immortal Pass.

40:51.710 --> 40:53.630
The Wu Army, which had been
winning successive victories,

40:53.630 --> 40:55.890
has now shifted from offense to defense.

40:56.230 --> 40:59.590
With your Power Gang's reputation
within the Daxi martial world,

40:59.590 --> 41:01.400
how could you ever earn everyone's trust?

41:01.400 --> 41:04.330
And now this sudden display
of patriotic concern...

41:05.030 --> 41:05.760
Mr. Xiao,

41:06.710 --> 41:09.150
let's put the right and wrong aside,

41:09.710 --> 41:11.000
But the Power Gang has never

41:11.000 --> 41:13.060
acted against the interests of Daxi.

41:17.710 --> 41:20.570
Where are the members
of the Wuyi Gang and Fuhu Sect?

41:20.840 --> 41:22.400
-Right.
-Where are they?

41:22.800 --> 41:24.550
-And what about the Guidao Sect?
-Yeah! Where are they?

41:24.550 --> 41:26.360
-Why aren't them here?
-How has no one noticed until now?

41:26.360 --> 41:27.160
Zhao Shirong!

41:27.630 --> 41:28.960
Did they set out together

41:28.960 --> 41:29.800
with your Power Gang?

41:29.800 --> 41:31.670
So why is there now
no trace of any of them?

41:31.670 --> 41:32.470
Zhao Shirong,

41:32.630 --> 41:33.760
you made this plan.

41:34.150 --> 41:35.400
They followed you.

41:35.800 --> 41:36.960
Where are they now?

41:37.670 --> 41:39.590
Your Power Gang
must have schemed in secret

41:39.590 --> 41:40.450
to murder them!

41:40.550 --> 41:43.030
Yes, it's you.

41:43.030 --> 41:44.190
-Right.
-That's right.

41:44.190 --> 41:45.670
-Exactly!
-That's right.

41:45.670 --> 41:46.760
-It was you!
-It was all your doing!

41:46.760 --> 41:47.960
Everyone, hear this:

41:51.960 --> 41:55.440
the Power Gang only executes
those who deserve to die.

41:56.670 --> 41:58.360
Arguing about it here will

41:59.150 --> 42:00.880
only delay what truly matters.

42:02.880 --> 42:06.340
Right now, our priority is
to retrieve the treasure—quickly.

42:06.880 --> 42:08.320
The Power Gang pledges this:

42:08.320 --> 42:11.520
one-tenth will be divided
among those who aided us today.

42:11.670 --> 42:13.000
As for the remainder...

42:13.280 --> 42:14.940
all of it shall belong to Daxi,

42:15.150 --> 42:16.550
to support the frontier.

42:22.150 --> 42:23.000
Which 10% ?

42:23.800 --> 42:25.000
There is so much here.

42:32.960 --> 42:33.590
Yiren!
